  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款 Serilum 出品的模组。用心制作。众多活跃的 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>微风自然生成（Breeze Spawn）为世界各地的烈焰人增加了以自然方式生成微风的机会。它们在 Minecraft 1.21 更新中被专门添加到试炼密室中，但有了这个模组，你将有几率在烈焰人可生成的地方自然遇到它们。默认情况下，1/10 的烈焰人会转化为微风，但该概率可在配置中更改。风弹攻击可是相当有挑战性的！</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/spawn-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的生成捆绑包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"运行环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详细内容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>chanceBlazeIsBreeze</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.1，最小值 0，最大值 1.0<br>生成的烈焰人变为微风实体的概率。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>微风可以在任何地方生成，但在有烈焰人刷怪箱的地方会最具挑战性：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/breeze-spawn/a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以在任意整合包中自由使用本模组，前提是下载文件仅托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事宜，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
